The '''Valley of Steel''' (Japanese: '''ハガネの{{tt|谷|たに}}''' ''Valley of Steel'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Hoenn]] [[region]] that appeared in ''[[AG058|All Torkoal, No Play]]''. It is located between [[Lavaridge Town]] and [[Mauville City]].

{{type|Steel}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} inhabit the valley, including its skies, and violently protect it from any intruders, including {{AP|Torkoal}}, who accidentally stumbled into the area. A road cutting across the Valley of Steel is considered a shortcut. There is a river close to Mauville City at the valley's edge.

{{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} were traveling through the Valley of Steel when they saw Torkoal being attacked by a {{pkmn2|wild}} Skarmory and {{p|Magnemite}}. After several skirmishes, Ash helped Torkoal defeat its rival, a {{p|Steelix}} who ruled over the valley. Afterwards, Torkoal decided to join his [[Party|team]].

